*：\n    1.  容器每次崩溃前的日志均明确显示 `runtime process exiting` 且伴随 HTTP 500 错误（见证据 #4, #7）。\n    2.  容器退出码为 2，非标准的 OOMKilled 退出码（137）。\n    3.  内存监控数据显示 `allocated_mib` 始终为 0，且内存限制（96Mi）与崩溃无直接关联，排除了资源不足引发的崩溃（见证据 #3, #5）。\n*   **未确认细节**：虽然确定是应用内部运行时错误，但缺乏具体的异常堆栈（Traceback），无法定位具体的代码分支或底层异常类型（如 `KeyError` 等）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 71.5s (Evidence 59.7s, RCA 11.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 106.099, "metrics": {"run_id": "6a49ef07930545d1", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 106.10509610176086, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分